law. Comment: This Principle provides a general hierarchy for determining the rules governing data contracts. At the top of that hierarchy are mandatory rules of applicable law that cannot be varied by agreement. Such mandatory rules differ from jurisdic - tion to jurisdiction. Examples of such rules include doctrines of unconscio - Principle 5 ALI-ELI PRINCIPLES FOR A DATA ECONOMY"